-70-volta\" class=\"hn-member-access__cta\">\n            Enter Volta\n            <span>→</span>\n          </a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article\n          class=\"hn-member-access__card\"\n          style=\"--accent:#37ff75; --accent-rgb:55,255,117; --card-show:var(--card-3);\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__card-top\">\n            <p>Precision Access</p>\n            <span>03</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__media\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0933/9378/1029/files/Hyfonic.png?v=1753182756\"\n              alt=\"Hyfonic 7 badminton racket\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n              width=\"900\"\n              height=\"900\"\n            >\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__card-body\">\n            <h3>Hyfonic 7</h3>\n            <h4>Control that refuses to wobble.</h4>\n            <p>\n              Stable, precise, and calm at match speed. For players who see the line before the shuttle moves.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__specs\">\n            <span>32 LBS</span>\n            <span>7.0MM</span>\n            <span>CONTROL</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <a href=\"/products/hyfonic-7-4u\" class=\"hn-member-access__cta\">\n            Enter Hyfonic\n            <span>→</span>\n          </a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article\n          class=\"hn-member-access__card\"\n          style=\"--accent:#ff4b2b; --accent-rgb:255,75,43; --card-show:var(--card-4);\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__card-top\">\n            <p>Speed Access</p>\n            <span>04</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__media\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0933/9378/1029/files/Flareon.png?v=1753182756\"\n              alt=\"Flareon 700 badminton racket\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n      